  "message": "make as_base_exp literal, like fraction (#26912)\n\nAlso removed was the attempt to turn an autoexpanded product of powers back into a power like `x**2*y**2 -> (x*y)**2`. There are several reasons not to do this. One important one is that there is no way to know what the original expression was so arbitrarily handling only one type is not the best thing to do; simplification into a given form should be done by the caller."
 },
