  "message": "ArrayAdd: do not allow scalar arguments (#30600)\n\n#### References to other Issues or PRs\n\nFixes #30398\n\n#### Brief description of what is fixed or changed\n\n`ArrayAdd` now raises `TypeError` on scalar arguments, like `MatAdd`\ndoes. Internally a sum of scalars becomes a plain `Add`, also when some\naddends are rank-0 array expressions such as a full contraction.\n\n#### Other comments\n\n`convert_array_to_matrix`, `convert_array_to_indexed` and `array_derive`\nneeded a case for `Add`.\n\n#### AI Generation Disclosure\n\nCode and description written by Claude Code (Claude Fable 5.1).\n\n#### Release Notes\n\n<!-- BEGIN RELEASE NOTES -->\n* tensor\n  * `ArrayAdd` no longer accepts scalar arguments.\n<!-- END RELEASE NOTES -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
 },
